#: src/reference/recipes/source-dependency-plugin.md:1
msgid "Source dependency plugin"
msgstr ""
"源码依赖插件"

#: src/reference/recipes/source-dependency-plugin.md:4
msgid ""
"```admonish note\n"
"The recipe section of the documentation focuses on the objectives\n"
"with minimal explanations.\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```admonish note\n"
"文档中的食谱部分以最少说明聚焦于目标。\n"
"```"

#: src/reference/recipes/source-dependency-plugin.md:10
msgid "Objective"
msgstr ""
"目标"

#: src/reference/recipes/source-dependency-plugin.md:13
msgid ""
"I want to use a plugin hosted on a git repository, without publishing to the "
"Central Repo."
msgstr ""
"我想使用托管在 git 仓库上的插件，而无需发布到中央仓库。"

#: src/reference/recipes/source-dependency-plugin.md:15
msgid "Steps"
msgstr ""
"步骤"

#: src/reference/recipes/source-dependency-plugin.md:18
msgid "Host an sbt 2.x plugin on a git repository, built using sbt 2.x."
msgstr ""
"在 git 仓库中托管 sbt 2.x 插件，并使用 sbt 2.x 构建。"

#: src/reference/recipes/source-dependency-plugin.md:19
msgid "Add the following to `project/plugins.sbt`:"
msgstr ""
"将以下内容添加到 `project/plugins.sbt`："

#: src/reference/recipes/source-dependency-plugin.md:21
msgid "// In project/plugins.sbt"
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/recipes/source-dependency-plugin.md:23
msgid ""
"\"https://github.com/eed3si9n/sbt-"
"jmh.git#303c3e98e1d1523e6a4f99abe09c900165028edb\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/recipes/source-dependency-plugin.md:24
msgid "\"plugin\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/recipes/source-dependency-plugin.md:27
msgid ""
"When you start sbt, it will automatically clone the repository under "
"`$HOME/.sbt/2/staging/`."
msgstr ""
"当您启动 sbt 时，会在 `$HOME/.sbt/2/staging/` 下自动克隆该仓库。"

#: src/reference/recipes/source-dependency-plugin.md:29
msgid ""
"In the above, `https://github.com/eed3si9n/sbt-jmh.git` is the HTTP endpoint "
"for a plugin hosted on GitHub, and "
"`303c3e98e1d1523e6a4f99abe09c900165028edb` is a commit id on the default "
"branch."
msgstr ""
"上例中，`https://github.com/eed3si9n/sbt-jmh.git` 是托管在 GitHub 上的插件的 HTTP 端点，"
"`303c3e98e1d1523e6a4f99abe09c900165028edb` 是默认分支上的提交 id。"
